        "id": 140593,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-25T18:27:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"kreistor\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9e8a1a/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kreistor:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm sorry, but Guise cannot use the Gun's power in the first place.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm sorry, but Guise can use the power on any equipment card if Guise's player played Lemme See That on an Equipment card.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/93562#comment-93562\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/comment/93562#comment-93562</a></p>",
