        "created_at": "2015-04-30T20:38:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry Reckless. I wasn't trying to yank a chain, I was just amused by the case where for once your allies aren't mad when you break their stuff. :) It's like how Absolute Zero doesn't mind stranded ongoings, which otherwise are just a mechanical annoyance.</p>",
