        "username": "Medic-Tank",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-02T18:46:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't see where the drama comes from in this case. No equipment destruction EVER targets spefically guns so if you destroy your gun before the ammo it contains well your just being as stupid as destroying the cards under the self destruct sequence before the self destruct sequence... If it wasn't a coop game and the villain could target cards then it would matter.&nbsp;</p>",
